@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #48664C
skinparam BorderColor #48664C
skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFCFA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF7E8
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D99A43
title Sequence - Dashboard Manajer dari Data Terintegrasi
actor Manager as "Manajer"
participant ManagerUI as "Dashboard Manajer"
participant ReportJS as "Reporting JS"
database Store as "localStorage App Data"

Manager -> ManagerUI : login Portal Klinik sebagai manager
ManagerUI -> ReportJS : renderManagerDashboard()
ReportJS -> Store : baca pets[] dan bookings[]
Store --> ReportJS : seluruh data klinik
ReportJS -> ReportJS : hitung jumlah pasien
ReportJS -> ReportJS : hitung booking dan completion rate
ReportJS -> ReportJS : jumlahkan pendapatan payment PAID
ReportJS -> ReportJS : hitung validasi, antrean, layanan, rujukan
ReportJS -> ReportJS : kelompokkan layanan populer
ReportJS --> ManagerUI : statistik, progres, dan tabel aktivitas
ManagerUI --> Manager : laporan operasional tampil
@enduml
